Subject: [PATCH v3 3/8] gpio: 104-dio-48e: Utilize for_each_set_clump macro
Date: Tue, 15 May 2018 11:50:29 -0400
Message-Id: <be0c1aa11a82e4ae497094410e5b94f5040ef79f.1526397764.git.vilhelm.gray@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.17.0
